#: includes/admin/trait-assets.php:119
msgid "Public recipient added. Click Save Changes to save it and enable age encryption."
msgstr "Publieke ontvanger bygevoeg. Klik Stoor veranderinge om dit te stoor en age-enkripsie te aktiveer."

#: includes/admin/trait-assets.php:120
msgid "Could not generate an age key. Try again in a modern browser over HTTPS or localhost."
msgstr "Kon nie ’n age-sleutel genereer nie. Probeer weer in ’n moderne blaaier oor HTTPS of localhost."

#: includes/admin/trait-assets.php:121
msgid "Local age key generation requires HTTPS (or localhost) and a modern browser with Web Crypto."
msgstr "Plaaslike age-sleutelgenerering vereis HTTPS (of localhost) en ’n moderne blaaier met Web Crypto."

#: includes/admin/trait-assets.php:122
msgid "You can save at most 100 recipient entries. Remove an entry before generating another key."
msgstr "Jy kan hoogstens 100 ontvangerinskrywings stoor. Verwyder ’n inskrywing voordat jy nog ’n sleutel genereer."

