#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:23
msgid "The encryption key was moved and verified. Storage destinations remain connected."
msgstr "Die enkripsiesleutel is geskuif en geverifieer. Bergingsbestemmings bly gekoppel."

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:37
msgid "A new encryption key is active. Previous keys were retained so existing backups and running jobs remain readable. Download a new recovery copy."
msgstr "’n Nuwe enkripsiesleutel is aktief. Vorige sleutels is behou sodat bestaande rugsteune en lopende take leesbaar bly. Laai ’n nuwe herstelkopie af."

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:40
msgid "The recovery key was restored, verified and made active. Other keys were retained so existing credentials remain readable."
msgstr "Die herstelsleutel is herstel, geverifieer en aktief gemaak. Ander sleutels is behou sodat bestaande toegangsbesonderhede leesbaar bly."

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:43
msgid "Encryption setup is complete."
msgstr "Enkripsie-opstelling is voltooi."

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:49
msgid "Restored credentials were upgraded and verified."
msgstr "Herstelde toegangsbesonderhede is opgegradeer en geverifieer."

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:52
msgid "A replacement encryption key was created. Reconnect storage destinations, then download a new recovery key. Your previous credentials have been kept for recovery with the original key."
msgstr "’n Vervangende enkripsiesleutel is geskep. Koppel bergingsbestemmings weer, laai dan ’n nuwe herstelsleutel af. Jou vorige toegangsbesonderhede is behou vir herstel met die oorspronklike sleutel."

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:118
msgid "Credential encryption"
msgstr "Toegangsbesonderhede-enkripsie"

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:120
msgid "Installation encryption keys are managed by your network administrator."
msgstr "Installasie-enkripsiesleutels word deur jou netwerkadministrateur bestuur."

#. translators: %s: Name of the environment variable.
#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:130
#, php-format
msgid "Credential keys are read from the %s environment variable. The disk-based credentials.php file is ignored while this variable is set."
msgstr "Toegangsbesonderhede-sleutels word uit die %s-omgewingsveranderlike gelees. Die skyfgebaseerde credentials.php-lêer word geïgnoreer terwyl hierdie veranderlike gestel is."

#. translators: %s: Name of the environment variable.
#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:131
msgid "Set it to a Base64 encoded JSON key configuration. WordPress does not rotate environment-managed keys; update the service configuration when the key age alert appears in backup reports."
msgstr "Stel dit op ’n Base64-gekodeerde JSON-sleutelkonfigurasie. WordPress roteer nie omgewingsbestuurde sleutels nie; werk die diensopstelling op wanneer die sleutelouderdomwaarskuwing in rugsteunverslae verskyn."

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:132
msgid "Environment key configuration is active."
msgstr "Omgewingsleutelkonfigurasie is aktief."

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:133
msgid "Download current recovery key"
msgstr "Laai huidige herstelsleutel af"

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:134
#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:144
msgid "If you restored storage settings from a backup made before credential encryption was upgraded, use this button to convert those restored credentials."
msgstr "As jy bergingsinstellings herstel het vanaf ’n rugsteun wat gemaak is voordat toegangsbesonderhede-enkripsie opgegradeer is, gebruik hierdie knoppie om daardie herstelde toegangsbesonderhede om te skakel."

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:135
#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:145
msgid "Upgrade restored credentials"
msgstr "Gradeer herstelde toegangsbesonderhede op"

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:137
msgid "BackupPlus automatically creates and protects the key used to encrypt credentials. No server setup is needed."
msgstr "BackupPlus skep en beskerm outomaties die sleutel wat gebruik word om toegangsbesonderhede te enkripteer. Geen bedieneropstelling is nodig nie."

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:138
msgid "Encryption is ready."
msgstr "Enkripsie is gereed."

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:139
msgid "Key storage folder"
msgstr "Sleutelbergingsvouer"

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:141
msgid "You can move the key to a dedicated writable folder outside wp-content or your website root, if your host allows it. BackupPlus moves and verifies the file for you. The key folder is omitted from unencrypted archives and appears as a separate backup source when age encryption is enabled."
msgstr "Jy kan die sleutel skuif na ’n toegewyde skryfbare vouer buite wp-content of jou webwerf se wortel, as jou gasheer dit toelaat. BackupPlus skuif en verifieer die lêer vir jou. Die sleutelvouer word uit onversleutelde argiewe weggelaat en verskyn as ’n aparte rugsteunbron wanneer age-enkripsie geaktiveer is."

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:142
msgid "Move key file"
msgstr "Skuif sleutellêer"

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:143
msgid "Retry encryption setup"
msgstr "Probeer enkripsie-opstelling weer"

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:146
msgid "Keep a recovery copy somewhere safe and separate from your backups. You can restore it here after moving your website or losing the key file. Treat this file as a password."
msgstr "Hou ’n herstelkopie êrens veilig en apart van jou rugsteune. Jy kan dit hier herstel nadat jy jou webwerf geskuif het of die sleutellêer verloor het. Behandel hierdie lêer soos ’n wagwoord."

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:147
msgid "Download recovery key"
msgstr "Laai herstelsleutel af"

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:148
msgid "Rotate encryption key"
msgstr "Roteer enkripsiesleutel"

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:149
msgid "Encryption keys rotate automatically every year through WordPress cron. You can also rotate them manually. Download a fresh recovery copy after rotation."
msgstr "Enkripsiesleutels roteer elke jaar outomaties deur WordPress-cron. Jy kan hulle ook handmatig roteer. Laai ná rotasie ’n nuwe herstelkopie af."

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:150
msgid "Restoring makes the recovery file's active key current. Other keys are kept so credentials saved since that recovery copy was downloaded remain readable."
msgstr "Met herstel word die herstellêer se aktiewe sleutel die huidige sleutel. Ander sleutels word behou sodat toegangsbesonderhede wat gestoor is sedert daardie herstelkopie afgelaai is, leesbaar bly."

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:151
msgid "Recovery key file"
msgstr "Herstelsleutellêer"

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:152
msgid "Choose your downloaded recovery key file first."
msgstr "Kies eers jou afgelaaide herstelsleutellêer."

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:152
msgid "Restore recovery key"
msgstr "Herstel herstelsleutel"

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:153
msgid "If the key file is missing and you have no recovery copy, create a replacement key and reconnect your storage destinations. This keeps the old credentials for later recovery but does not unlock them."
msgstr "As die sleutellêer ontbreek en jy geen herstelkopie het nie, skep ’n vervangende sleutel en koppel jou bergingsbestemmings weer. Dit behou die ou toegangsbesonderhede vir latere herstel, maar ontsluit hulle nie."

#: includes/class-credential-key-admin.php:154
msgid "Replace missing key"
msgstr "Vervang ontbrekende sleutel"

#: includes/class-credential-key-rotation.php:27
msgid "Annually"
msgstr "Jaarliks"

#: includes/class-credential-key-rotation.php:179
msgid "Credential key maintenance alert"
msgstr "Waarskuwing oor toegangsbesonderhede-sleutelonderhoud"

#: includes/class-credential-key-rotation.php:180
msgid "BackupPlus could not confirm that credential key maintenance completed. Check the key status in Settings → Expert settings → Credential encryption."
msgstr "BackupPlus kon nie bevestig dat die onderhoud van die toegangsbesonderhede-sleutel voltooi is nie. Gaan die sleutelstatus na in Instellings → Kenner-instellings → Toegangsbesonderhede-enkripsie."

#: includes/class-credential-key-rotation.php:195
msgid "Rotate it in the service environment configuration; WordPress cannot rotate environment-managed keys."
msgstr "Roteer dit in die diensomgewing se konfigurasie; WordPress kan nie omgewingsbestuurde sleutels roteer nie."

#: includes/class-credential-key-rotation.php:196
msgid "Check that WordPress cron is running, or rotate the key in BackupPlus Settings."
msgstr "Gaan na dat WordPress-cron loop, of roteer die sleutel in die BackupPlus-instellings."

#: includes/class-credential-key-rotation.php:198
msgid "Credential key age alert"
msgstr "Waarskuwing oor ouderdom van toegangsbesonderhede-sleutel"

#. translators: 1: date the active key was issued, 2: age in days, 3: rotation guidance
#: includes/class-credential-key-rotation.php:201
#, php-format
msgid "The active credential encryption key was issued on %1$s and is %2$s days old. %3$s"
msgstr "Die aktiewe toegangsbesonderhede-enkripsiesleutel is op %1$s uitgereik en is %2$s dae oud. %3$s"

#. translators: %s: site name
#: includes/class-credential-key-rotation.php:237
#, php-format
msgid "BackupPlus credential key rotated for %s"
msgstr "BackupPlus-toegangsbesonderhede-sleutel geroteer vir %s"

#. translators: 1: site URL, 2: date and time
#: includes/class-credential-key-rotation.php:242
#, php-format
msgid "The credential encryption key for %1$s was rotated successfully. The active key was issued on %2$s. Previous keys were retained so existing credentials and jobs remain readable. Download a fresh recovery key from BackupPlus Settings."
msgstr "Die toegangsbesonderhede-enkripsiesleutel vir %1$s is suksesvol geroteer. Die aktiewe sleutel is op %2$s uitgereik. Vorige sleutels is behou sodat bestaande toegangsbesonderhede en take leesbaar bly. Laai ’n nuwe herstelsleutel af vanaf die BackupPlus-instellings."

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:79
msgid "Encryption settings were not changed. Choose Disabled or age public keys, check the public recipients and GitHub accounts, then save again."
msgstr "Enkripsie-instellings is nie verander nie. Kies Gedeaktiveer of age-publieke sleutels, gaan die publieke ontvangers en GitHub-rekenings na, en stoor dan weer."

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:126
#: templates/wp-admin/settings/form-contents.php:305
msgid "Backup encryption"
msgstr "Rugsteun-enkripsie"

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:131 includes/class-pitr-admin.php:332
#: templates/wp-admin/settings/form-contents.php:57
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Gedeaktiveer"

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:132
msgid "age public keys"
msgstr "age-publieke sleutels"

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:138
msgid "The saved backup encryption mode is no longer supported. Choose Disabled or age public keys and save changes before running backups."
msgstr "Die gestoorde rugsteun-enkripsiemodus word nie meer ondersteun nie. Kies Gedeaktiveer of age-publieke sleutels en stoor veranderinge voordat jy rugsteune laat loop."

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:140
msgid "Encrypts database dumps and every file archive, including split tar/Zstandard parts. Encryption must complete before files are uploaded."
msgstr "Enkripteer databasisstorte en elke lêerargief, insluitend verdeelde tar/Zstandard-dele. Enkripsie moet voltooi wees voordat lêers opgelaai word."

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:141
msgid "age recipients, one per line"
msgstr "age-ontvangers, een per reël"

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:143
msgid "Generate age key in browser"
msgstr "Genereer age-sleutel in blaaier"

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:146
msgid "Save your private age key"
msgstr "Stoor jou private age-sleutel"

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:147
msgid "Download the private key and keep it somewhere safe, separate from your backups. You will need it to decrypt or restore backups. BackupPlus cannot recover it for you."
msgstr "Laai die private sleutel af en hou dit êrens veilig, apart van jou rugsteune. Jy sal dit nodig hê om rugsteune te dekripteer of te herstel. BackupPlus kan dit nie vir jou herwin nie."

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:148
msgid "The private key is generated in your browser and is never sent to the server."
msgstr "Die private sleutel word in jou blaaier gegenereer en word nooit na die bediener gestuur nie."

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:149
msgid "Download private key"
msgstr "Laai private sleutel af"

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:150
msgid "I have saved my private key somewhere safe."
msgstr "Ek het my private sleutel êrens veilig gestoor."

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:151
msgid "Public recipient:"
msgstr "Publieke ontvanger:"

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:153
msgid "Add public recipient"
msgstr "Voeg publieke ontvanger by"

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:157
msgid "Use age1… recipients, SSH RSA/Ed25519 public keys, or github:USERNAME. GitHub keys are fetched and pinned when you save; save again to refresh them. Backups use every saved recipient without contacting GitHub."
msgstr "Gebruik age1…-ontvangers, SSH RSA/Ed25519-publieke sleutels, of github:USERNAME. GitHub-sleutels word gehaal en vasgepen wanneer jy stoor; stoor weer om hulle te verfris. Rugsteune gebruik elke gestoorde ontvanger sonder om GitHub te kontak."

#. translators: %d: Number of saved public recipients.
#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:158
#, php-format
msgid "Saved public recipients: %d. Each recipient can decrypt the backup. Keep the corresponding private key for restoration; it is never saved here."
msgstr "Gestoorde publieke ontvangers: %d. Elke ontvanger kan die rugsteun dekripteer. Hou die ooreenstemmende private sleutel vir herstel; dit word nooit hier gestoor nie."

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:166
msgid "age identity or SSH/PEM private key (age-encrypted archives)"
msgstr "age-identiteit of SSH/PEM-private-sleutel (age-versleutelde argiewe)"

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:168
#: templates/wp-admin/settings/tab-extract.php:29
msgid "Private key passphrase, if encrypted"
msgstr "Private-sleutel-wagfrase, indien versleuteld"

#: includes/class-database-encryption.php:171
msgid "Archives are decrypted in your browser, then a plaintext copy is uploaded for this restore. Your private key and its passphrase are never sent to the server."
msgstr "Argiewe word in jou blaaier gedekripteer, waarna ’n gewone-teks-kopie vir hierdie herstel opgelaai word. Jou private sleutel en sy wagfrase word nooit na die bediener gestuur nie."

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:26
msgid "Multiple Choices."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:26
msgid "Indicates multiple options for the resource from which the client may choose (via agent-driven content negotiation)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:27
msgid "Moved Permanently."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:27
#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:33
msgid "This and all future requests should be directed to the given URI."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:28
msgid "Found (Previously \"Moved temporarily\")."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:28
msgid "Tells the client to look at (browse to) another URL."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:29
msgid "See Other."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:29
msgid "The response to the request can be found under another URI using the GET method."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:29
msgid "When received in response to a POST (or PUT/DELETE), the client should presume that the server has received the data and should issue a new GET request to the given URI"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:30
msgid "Not Modified."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:30
msgid "Indicates that the resource has not been modified since the version specified by the request headers If-Modified-Since or If-None-Match."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:31
msgid "Use Proxy."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:31
msgid "The requested resource is available only through a proxy, the address for which is provided in the response."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:32
msgid "Temporary Redirect."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:32
msgid "In this case, the request should be repeated with another URI; however, future requests should still use the original URI."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:33
msgid "Permanent Redirect."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:39
msgid "Bad Request."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:39
msgid "The server cannot or will not process the request due to an apparent client error (e.g., malformed request syntax, size too large, invalid request message framing, or deceptive request routing)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:40
msgid "Unauthorized."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:40
msgid "Authentication is required and has failed or has not yet been provided."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:41
msgid "Forbidden."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:41
msgid "The request contained valid data and was understood by the server, but the server is refusing action."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:41
msgid "This may be due to the user not having the necessary permissions for a resource or needing an account of some sort, or attempting a prohibited action (e.g. creating a duplicate record where only one is allowed)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:42
msgid "Not Found."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:42
msgid "The requested resource could not be found but may be available in the future"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:42
msgid "Subsequent requests by the client are permissible."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:43
msgid "Method Not Allowed"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:43
msgid "A request method is not supported for the requested resource; for example, a GET request on a form that requires data to be presented via POST, or a PUT request on a read-only resource."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:44
msgid "Not Acceptable"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:44
msgid "The requested resource is capable of generating only content not acceptable according to the Accept headers sent in the request."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:45
msgid "Proxy Authentication Required"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:45
msgid "The client must first authenticate itself with the proxy."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:46
msgid "Request Timeout"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:46
msgid "The server timed out waiting for the request"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:46
msgid "The client MAY repeat the request without modifications at any later time."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:47
msgid "Conflict"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:47
msgid "Indicates that the request could not be processed because of conflict in the current state of the resource, such as an edit conflict between multiple simultaneous updates."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:48
msgid "Gone"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:48
msgid "Indicates that the resource requested is no longer available and will not be available again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:49
msgid "Length Required"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:49
msgid "The request did not specify the length of its content, which is required by the requested resource."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:50
msgid "Precondition Failed"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:50
msgid "The server does not meet one of the preconditions that the requester put on the request header fields."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:51
msgid "Payload Too Large"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:51
msgid "The request is larger than the server is willing or able to process"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:51
msgid "Previously called \"Request Entity Too Large\"."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:52
msgid "URI Too Long"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:52
msgid "The URI provided was too long for the server to process"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:52
msgid "Often the result of too much data being encoded as a query-string of a GET request, in which it should be converted to a POST request."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:53
msgid "Unsupported Media Type"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:53
msgid "The request entity has a media type which the server or resource does not support"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:53
msgid "For example, the client uploads an image as image/svg+xml, but the server requires that images use a different format."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:54
msgid "Range Not Satisfiable"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:54
msgid "The client has asked for a portion of the file (byte serving), but the server cannot supply that portion"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:54
msgid "For example, if the client asked for a part of the file that lies beyond the end of the file."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:55
msgid "Expectation Failed"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:55
msgid "The server cannot meet the requirements of the Expect request-header field."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:56
msgid "Misdirected Request"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:56
msgid "The request was directed at a server that is not able to produce a response (for example because of connection reuse)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:57
msgid "Unprocessable Entity"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:57
msgid "The request was well-formed but was unable to be followed due to semantic errors."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:58
msgid "Locked"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:58
msgid "The resource that is being accessed is locked."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:59
msgid "Failed Dependency"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:59
msgid "The request failed because it depended on another request and that request failed (e.g., a PROPPATCH)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:60
msgid "Too Early"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:60
msgid "Indicates that the server is unwilling to risk processing a request that might be replayed."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:61
msgid "Upgrade Required"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:61
msgid "The client should switch to a different protocol such as TLS/1.3, given in the Upgrade header field."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:62
msgid "Precondition Required"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:62
msgid "The origin server requires the request to be conditional"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:62
msgid "Intended to prevent the 'lost update' problem, where a client GETs a resource's state, modifies it, and PUTs it back to the server, when meanwhile a third party has modified the state on the server, leading to a conflict."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:63
msgid "Too Many Requests"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:63
msgid "The user has sent too many requests in a given amount of time"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:63
msgid "Intended for use with rate-limiting schemes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:64
msgid "Request Header Fields Too Large"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:64
msgid "The server is unwilling to process the request because either an individual header field, or all the header fields collectively, are too large."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:65
msgid "Unavailable For Legal Reasons"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:65
msgid "A server operator has received a legal demand to deny access to a resource or to a set of resources that includes the requested resource."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:71
msgid "Internal Server Error"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:71
msgid "A generic error message, given when an unexpected condition was encountered and no more specific message is suitable."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:72
msgid "Not Implemented"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:72
msgid "The server either does not recognize the request method, or it lacks the ability to fulfil the request"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:72
msgid "Usually this implies future availability (e.g., a new feature of a web-service API)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:73
msgid "Bad Gateway"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:73
msgid "The server was acting as a gateway or proxy and received an invalid response from the upstream server."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:74
msgid "Service Unavailable"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:74
msgid "The server cannot handle the request (because it is overloaded or down for maintenance)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:74
msgid "Generally, this is a temporary state."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:75
msgid "Gateway Timeout"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:75
msgid "The server was acting as a gateway or proxy and did not receive a timely response from the upstream server."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:76
msgid "HTTP Version Not Supported"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:76
msgid "The server does not support the HTTP protocol version used in the request."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:77
msgid "Variant Also Negotiates"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:77
msgid "Transparent content negotiation for the request results in a circular reference."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:78
msgid "Insufficient Storage"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:78
msgid "The server is unable to store the representation needed to complete the request."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:79
msgid "Loop Detected"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:79
msgid "The server detected an infinite loop while processing the request."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:80
msgid "Not Extended"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:80
msgid "Further extensions to the request are required for the server to fulfil it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:81
msgid "Network Authentication Required"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:81
msgid "The client needs to authenticate to gain network access"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-http-error-descriptions.php:81
msgid "Intended for use by intercepting proxies used to control access to the network (e.g., \"captive portals\" used to require agreement to Terms of Service before granting full Internet access via a Wi-Fi hotspot)."
msgstr ""

