msgstr "BackupPlus maak ’n WordPress-netwerk as geheel rugsteun en herstel dit, daarom kan dit slegs vir die hele netwerk geaktiveer word. Aktiveer dit vanaf Netwerkadmin → Inproppe."

#: includes/class-multisite.php:69
msgid "Plugin could not be activated"
msgstr "Inprop kon nie geaktiveer word nie"

#: includes/class-multisite.php:113
msgid "On a WordPress network, BackupPlus must be activated for the entire network. It backs up and restores every site of the network, and is managed from Network Admin."
msgstr "Op ’n WordPress-netwerk moet BackupPlus vir die hele netwerk geaktiveer word. Dit maak elke werf van die netwerk rugsteun en herstel dit, en word vanaf Netwerkadmin bestuur."

#: includes/class-multisite.php:114
msgid "Go to Network Admin → Plugins"
msgstr "Gaan na Netwerkadmin → Inproppe"

#: includes/class-pitr-admin.php:72
